# Writer 11 (tally 2.1, 2.1-17, R-2, C-9). L §6.1 A member is closed: "The prelude (§5.7) is one, in the joint model and
# in every member, so its kinds are shared: parties among them, so every member's owners are things of one kind ...,
# while two members' parties are one party only by a same line on the things (same a.ania = d.anna)"; What same does:
# "A party stated same is one owner: of p reads the parts labelled with either side, in every member (§3.6)". ania's
# 100.00 in a.konto and anna's 60.00 in b.konto (figures carried) read as one owner's from either side; the parties bound
# once.
=== options pin=bytes
=== joint.tally
model family
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  use a = "ana.tally" sha256 "9064ad8937cf5113e0f7f60f705feaf14574d1370ca64a1657c182f6f6fa2bf4"
  use b = "ben.tally" sha256 "23c7150c78e0bdf381a51060612179fece1874cd32eda912b468cc76e86ff9a7"
  same a.ania = b.anna


ask t: bal(a.konto, 2026-06-30) of a.ania, bal(b.konto, 2026-06-30) of a.ania, bal(b.konto, 2026-06-30) of b.anna, bal(a.konto, 2026-06-30) of b.anna
ask n: count(p in parties on 2026-06-30)
=== ana.tally
model ana
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind savings: place PLN min 0
  owned by arrive
  step minor(PLN)
  takes k for w prorata
place konto: savings lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input d1: date
input a1: money PLN
def arrive[m in events, p in parties]: num = if p == ania then 1 else 0 at m.day
move dep: transfers
  on d1
  leg cash from world to konto amount a1

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  parties + [ania] lives 1980-01-01..
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  d1 = 2026-02-01
  a1 = 100.00 PLN

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-06-30) of ania
=== ben.tally
model ben
